agraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn cards and resources by playing PvP, PvE and completing daily, weekly and monthly challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use these resources to craft new cards and improve your decks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0c A rich and mysterious universe to explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as the latest prodigy at an orphanage training future Psycogs, tacticians capable of controlling Mutants. Discover the secrets that lurk in the shadows of this institution and forge your legend in tournaments around the world!Mutants: Genesis takes you through two story arcs that explore the game's universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
